# Loaded only by `bun run build:embedded` (vite --mode embedded), and overrides .env.
#
# The embedded build is vendored into VideoAnnotator's src/videoannotator/viewer_static/,
# which is committed to a public repo and served at /viewer by whichever server
# ships it. So it must carry no credentials and no fixed server address:
#   - empty VITE_API_BASE_URL = same-origin, i.e. the server that served the page
#   - empty VITE_API_TOKEN    = the user connects with their own key in Settings
# Without this file, a developer's .env token was baked into the public bundle.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
VITE_API_TOKEN=
